Add tours field to Contact and subclasses","messageBody":"Contact and its subclasses do not support associating tours with\ncontacts.\n\nThis is needed to allow filtering contacts by tour.\n\nLet\u0027s,\n* Remove Set\u003cContact\u003e from Tour class\n* Add Set\u003cTour\u003e field to abstract Contact class\n* Add tours logic to all Contact subclasses\n* Update AddCommand parser to support tours input\n* Use empty Set\u003cTour\u003e as placeholder in test cases\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":145,"deletions":78}}},{"hash":"c88e1b81011a2bfd9cbdcfd45b5da3e8badd3a31","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"ContactCard: Display type-specific details for each Contact type","messageBody":"ContactCard does not show type-specific details for Contact subclasses,\ndisplaying only base fields for all contact types.\n\nThis makes it hard for users to distinguish between contact types at\na glance.\n\nLet\u0027s,\n* Add getTypeSpecificDetails() abstract method to Contact class\n* Implement getTypeSpecificDetails() in all Contact subclasses\n* Update ContactCard to display type-specific details\n* Update ContactListCard.fxml to include detailsBox for type details\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":41,"deletions":7}}},{"hash":"705bb15981ef35c3f76493b78c6e95d8c86ec6d5","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Contact class: Add tours field to Contact and subclasses","messageBody":"Contact and its subclasses do not support associating tours with\ncontacts.\n\nThis is needed to allow filtering contacts by tour.\n\nLet\u0027s,\n* Remove Set\u003cContact\u003e from Tour class\n* Add Set\u003cTour\u003e field to abstract Contact class\n* Add tours logic to all Contact subclasses\n* Update AddCommand parser to support tours input\n* Use empty Set\u003cTour\u003e as placeholder in test cases\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":145,"deletions":78}}},{"hash":"84dc95c50a3632d710a246e93d801be607fb3cf